485	
486	  /* Initialize the underlying ESP-HAL esp_timer subsystem.
487	   * This calls esp_timer_init() which creates the timer task and sets up
488	   * the LACT hardware alarm ISR. The NuttX OS adapter layer (os.c)
489	   * provides nxtask_init-based task creation and native interrupt
490	   * allocation, so this no longer hits ROM functions that would cause
491	   * PMP faults.
492	   */
