299	  /* RAM debug marker dump.  Reads the app-only marker address (0x5010ffe0):
300	   * boot's own dbg_putc() markers go to 0x5010fff0 and would clobber the
301	   * value before this dump runs, so the two are kept separate.  The app
302	   * marker survives a warm reset and tells us the last point the previous
303	   * app run reached, independent of the lossy USB console.
